Z||000002||ray b||06-11-2001||01:26 PM||||the fiero 2.8 has big valves that no other <BR>2.8 used.so a rebuilt 2.8 as used in other gm cars ain't the same as fiero's v-6.<BR>just get a ironhead 3.4 and drill the starter holes on the other side. or a short block[no heads] and redo the fiero heads.<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
